# .foveignore — FoveAI self-development protection layers
#
# Every path matching a pattern here is a PROTECTED layer: the agent's
# <self:edit>/<self:codedit> tags are filed as proposals for architect
# review instead of being applied directly. Everything else inside the
# repo is OPEN for self-edits. Paths outside the repo are always
# PROTECTED. Secrets (.env, keys, tokens, .ssh …) are FORBIDDEN at code
# level and can never be unlocked by editing this file — nor can this
# file unlock itself (it is hardcoded protected).
#
# Syntax: gitignore-style globs, one per line.  # = comment
#   Backend/app/        — protects a directory prefix
#   Backend/config.yaml — protects one file
#   *.service           — glob
#   !Backend/app/README.md — '!' re-opens a subpath back to OPEN

# ── Core brain & runtime ──────────────────────────────
Backend/app/
Backend/Cognition/compagent.py
Backend/Cognition/autonomous_agent.py
Backend/Cognition/coder_agent.py
Backend/Cognition/MindCore*
Backend/Cognition/persistent_memory*
Backend/config.yaml
Backend/preflight/

# ── Launchers, services, lifecycle ────────────────────
sleipnir_launcher*
FoveAI_Console.py
FoveAI_Taskbar*
*.service
*.timer

# ── Governance & memory of record ─────────────────────
.foveignore
AGENTS.md
AGENT.md
CLAUDE.md
Backend/data/agent_proposals.jsonl
Backend/data/self_edits/

# ── Authentication / access control surfaces ──────────
**/auth*.py
**/multigate*/**/auth*
.env*
